# Alerts and detections, which used to reach this client and vanish.
#
# ALERT_APP and DETECTION_SENSOR_APP are both "same as Text Message" upstream - plain text on a
# channel - and were simply never accepted by the ingest, so a sensor tripping or an alert going
# out produced nothing at all. They now land in the channel they were sent on, headed with what
# they are: a run of identical-looking bubbles is exactly what a critical alert must not be.

scene demo
tab messages

# Open the primary channel.
key down 1
key a
hold 600

detection CHRL Door detected
hold 900

alert ALFA Rockfall on the north trail, do not descend
hold 1600
